Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.20,0:00:02.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can even win a reward!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.66,0:00:08.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I adjusted the transfer circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.74,0:00:12.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now it will only facilitate travel between\Nhere and the Clearflow Lake Stratum.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.78,0:00:14.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, and don't worry,\Nmonsters can't use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.88,0:00:16.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I made sure. Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.48,0:00:17.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good work, Hulemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.52,0:00:18.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.30,0:00:20.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, working hard, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.00,0:00:22.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gotta say, I am impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.94,0:00:26.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once things settle down a bit, we should\Nhead to the Clearflow Lake Stratum.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.94,0:00:28.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, we're done with our patrol duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.88,0:00:31.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't see any remnants in the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.44,0:00:32.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, I'm tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.08,0:00:37.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain, wanna tell me why I got\Npaired with the pervert? Who? Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.52,0:00:39.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is someone using illusion magic, perhaps?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.26,0:00:42.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where is the pervert of whom you speak?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.94,0:00:45.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Each of us has to take\Ntheir turn standing watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.72,0:00:47.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's just the way it worked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.50,0:00:49.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I take no issue with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.48,0:00:53.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, is it not a gentleman's\Nduty to protect a small, frail lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.24,0:00:56.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Shui, relax!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.78,0:00:57.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me to relax!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.92,0:01:00.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He kept digging old shoes\Nout of the collapsed houses,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.46,0:01:02.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I had to watch his nose twitch\Nwhile he tried to smell them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.92,0:01:03.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's disgusting!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.40,0:01:05.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.32,0:01:07.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did not know she was emotionally\Nunstable, the poor dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.98,0:01:09.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Snip this! Get at it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.74,0:01:13.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, this is some high-level combat.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.16,0:01:16.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too bad it's between comrades, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.68,0:01:19.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Boxxo, you got a\Nmoment to talk? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.46,0:01:21.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.84,0:01:25.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think you could stop by the Menagerie\Nof Fool's base once you're done here?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.64,0:01:26.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eh? Here?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.00,0:01:30.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, in the origin stratum, conveniently.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:33.11,0:01:35.99,sign_1939_25_Reborn_as_a_Vend,title,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(773,1)\an8\fs20}Reborn as a Vending Machine, {\fnTimes New Roman\c&H020222&}I {\c&H161C79&}Now {\c&H1C379A&}Wander {\c&H1D6FE2&}the {\c&H2D9CED&}Dungeon
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.80,0:01:42.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the outside, I'm just a big metal box,\Nbut inside, I've still got a human soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.76,0:01:43.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In this new world of wonders,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:43.37,0:01:49.25,sign_1939_25_Reborn_as_a_Vend,title,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(773,1)\an8\fs20}Reborn as a Vending Machine, {\fnTimes New Roman\c&H020222&}I {\c&H161C79&}Now {\c&H1C379A&}Wander {\c&H1D6FE2&}the {\c&H2D9CED&}Dungeon
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.98,0:01:46.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I travel to and fro on the back\Nof my super-strong partner,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.98,0:01:47.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lamas.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.89,0:01:49.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The name's Boxxo. Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.16,0:01:51.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means yes, by the way.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:06.08,0:03:09.96,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(734,438)\fscx65\pos(501.4,50)}Sweet Temptation
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.32,0:03:08.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.23,0:03:11.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't know the Menagerie had\Ntheir base in the Origins, Stratum.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.46,0:03:14.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for agreeing to talk, my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.46,0:03:18.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have something we need to tell\Nyou, and it's long past overdue.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.92,0:03:20.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.92,0:03:22.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They deserve to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.32,0:03:23.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'd be best.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.06,0:03:24.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.97,0:03:27.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did I just see a shadow\Ncross Vilmina's face?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.36,0:03:30.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The red and white twins' mood\Nseems to have shifted, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.60,0:03:32.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.32,0:03:35.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, that's enough\Nmessing around, you two!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.10,0:03:36.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just give me a few more minutes!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.76,0:03:39.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I almost sunk one right\Nthrough this jerk's eye!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.34,0:03:40.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is odd.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.34,0:03:42.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is someone using mental\Nmanipulation magic?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.36,0:03:44.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I hear strange childish chatter.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.54,0:03:46.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.45,0:03:49.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems we'll have to wait for\Nthese two fools to settle down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.14,0:03:51.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But then you can all\Nfollow us to our base.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.46,0:03:52.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.92,0:03:55.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is all news to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.46,0:03:59.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had no idea the Menagerie of Fools\Nbase was in the Origin Stratum.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.16,0:04:01.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we didn't want many people to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.48,0:04:05.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, how long have you been a member\Nof the Menagerie of Fools, Shui?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.08,0:04:07.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hasn't even been two years yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.26,0:04:10.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, are you telling me that Heavy's\Nbeen a member longer than you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.82,0:04:12.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I am indeed her senior.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.22,0:04:15.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though it is worth noting\Nthat we do not operate under a
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.58,0:04:18.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,troublesome vertical hierarchy\Nhere in the Menagerie of Fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.06,0:04:19.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we did,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.97,0:04:24.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that would require me to treat Aka and\NShiro with the respect one shows a superior.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.32,0:04:25.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.62,0:04:27.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't the twins quite\Na bit younger than you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.56,0:04:28.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are correct, Hulemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.28,0:04:30.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nevertheless,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.19,0:04:34.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the founding members of the menagerie are\NCaptain Kerioyl, Vice-Captain Filmina,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.38,0:04:36.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and then Aka and Shiro as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.56,0:04:38.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those four started it all. Oh really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.94,0:04:41.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't even know that\Nand I'm a member too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.20,0:04:43.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the first time Shui's heard this too?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.14,0:04:46.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that you mention it, those four\Nall disappear at once pretty often,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.78,0:04:48.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and they seem to work together a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.88,0:04:52.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're curious, you should\Nask them about it later.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.46,0:04:53.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.96,0:04:56.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, forgive my inattention, Master Boxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.80,0:04:58.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hearing all that reminded me,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.56,0:05:01.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's something I've been wondering\Nabout for quite a while now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.44,0:05:02.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.48,0:05:05.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a sense I have about\NAka and Shiro's presence.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.54,0:05:06.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.24,0:05:10.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shouldn't go around\Nspeculating about such things.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.58,0:05:14.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, now that you said something,\NI am going to fixate on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.92,0:05:17.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.96,0:05:20.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here you have it, the Menagerie's base.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.18,0:05:23.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, there's plenty of\Nventilation, I'll give you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.84,0:05:25.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's a decoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.92,0:05:28.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The real base is beyond this hidden door.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.96,0:05:34.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, come on down, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.96,0:05:38.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, please, wherever you'd like, friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.16,0:05:42.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxo, would you mind dispensing\Nsome refreshments for everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.66,0:05:43.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:44.23,0:05:45.74,sign_2664_34_Megumi_Natural_W,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H5B533F&\3c&HECEEF5&\fs20}Kocha Kadan
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.06,0:05:47.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the Menagerie of Fools hideout.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.28,0:05:50.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've gathered you here\Ntoday for one reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.92,0:05:54.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We figured it's time to share\Nour objective with you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.66,0:05:56.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First, a quick review.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.26,0:05:59.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you all remember\Nhow you can have a single
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.34,0:06:01.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wish granted if you're able\Nto master this dungeon,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.88,0:06:02.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.79,0:06:04.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shall grant thee one\Nwish of thy choosing!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.64,0:06:07.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But only if thou reachest\Nthe lowest stratum?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.34,0:06:09.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And offerest thy proof\Nthat thou hast subdued.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.96,0:06:12.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a formidable stratum lord, end quote.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.50,0:06:13.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So goes the legend.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.32,0:06:16.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and there was once a team?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.22,0:06:17.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who reached the bottom\Nstratum of a dungeon!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.02,0:06:19.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in a land to the southwest.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.90,0:06:23.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Word in the strata is that they\Ndid get their wishes granted.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.54,0:06:27.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that's apparently when the\Ndungeon ceased to exist. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.46,0:06:28.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.38,0:06:30.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you saying that if somebody\Ngets their wish granted,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.68,0:06:33.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Clearflow Lake stratum\Nwill just disappear?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.10,0:06:34.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what I'm getting at.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.64,0:06:38.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what happens to all the people\Ninside a dungeon when it ceases to exist?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.72,0:06:42.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, as I understand, they\Nget forcefully ejected from it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.24,0:06:43.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But don't worry,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.15,0:06:47.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I made good and sure that nobody would\Nbe destroyed along with the dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.90,0:06:48.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.81,0:06:50.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So the residents won't\Nget caught up in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.90,0:06:51.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.80,0:06:56.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Vice-Captain and I felt it was\Ntime that we revealed our wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.48,0:07:00.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we're sorry to have kept it a\Nsecret from you for so damn long.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.64,0:07:05.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.55,0:07:08.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's actually been a\Ndoor there this whole time?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.24,0:07:09.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Follow me this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.86,0:07:15.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.77,0:07:17.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What in the world is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.92,0:07:20.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously, what's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.76,0:07:25.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While it is faint, I do\Nsense a presence here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.54,0:07:27.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I assume this youth is not dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.96,0:07:34.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This boy...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.08,0:07:36.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, Filmina and I are his parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.68,0:07:40.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did he say boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.46,0:07:43.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As the captain says, this boy is our son.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.80,0:07:45.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I am thoroughly confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.84,0:07:48.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on, why isn't anyone\Nhaving much of a reaction?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.96,0:07:52.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would assume a revelation like\Nthis would elicit shouts of surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.60,0:07:53.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.58,0:07:55.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're telling us you two are married?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.54,0:07:57.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what I was waiting for, Lamas.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.30,0:08:00.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could tell there was something\Ngoing on between them by the fighting,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.28,0:08:03.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I had no clue they\Nwere married with a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.38,0:08:06.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Much less that their kid\Nwas asleep inside a crystal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.08,0:08:08.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'd be much more unnatural\Nnot to be surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.98,0:08:10.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry to keep it a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.74,0:08:13.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been nearly 20 years\Nsince we got married.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.68,0:08:15.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, my love. That it has.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.24,0:08:19.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We might as well share that Aka\Nand Shiro are our sons, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.74,0:08:20.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.92,0:08:22.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised you never caught on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.04,0:08:24.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry for the secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.94,0:08:28.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.62,0:08:30.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aka and Shiro's presence\Nalways seemed similar
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.98,0:08:33.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to the captains and vice-captains to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.50,0:08:34.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What, not surprised, Evie?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.06,0:08:37.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen you lose your\Ncool, and to be perfectly frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.98,0:08:39.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was kind of looking forward to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.80,0:08:42.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to betray your\Nexpectations, Captain,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.38,0:08:45.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I've had a vague notion\Nof it for a while now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.52,0:08:47.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, you really are a\Ncunning one, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.98,0:08:51.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I guess all this means that you two\Nare that boy's big brothers then, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.74,0:08:52.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not quite.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.65,0:08:54.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's actually the oldest.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.14,0:08:56.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep, matter of fact, we're triplets.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.50,0:08:57.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.78,0:08:58.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.96,0:09:01.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before we reveal our wishes to you all,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.24,0:09:04.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we should explain the situation\Nwith our sleeping son here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.18,0:09:09.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and me, I bet you already\Nknow what this crystal is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.08,0:09:11.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it seems like it's\Nsome form of crystal coffin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.06,0:09:12.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.98,0:09:14.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.24,0:09:15.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not following.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.86,0:09:19.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's an old magic item, though\Nancient might be an even better word.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.58,0:09:22.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you're inside one, a\Nperson becomes frozen in time,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.82,0:09:25.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with all their biological\Nprocesses halted.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.78,0:09:27.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's in there for a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.36,0:09:28.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He has a negative blessing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.30,0:09:30.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A negative blessing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.16,0:09:33.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As you know, blessings are superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.00,0:09:36.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're bestowed upon\Nus by a benevolent god.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.00,0:09:40.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lamas has the blessing of might,\Nand I guess Boxo has his barrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.58,0:09:43.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the other hand, a negative\Nblessing is the opposite.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.92,0:09:46.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A worthless power bestowed\Nby a malevolent god.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.32,0:09:50.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks to that, our son couldn't\Neven manage everyday life.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.50,0:09:54.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We couldn't bear to watch\Nhim get worse by the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.80,0:09:57.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So we decided to let him\Nstay here, unconscious,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.58,0:09:59.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,until we could find a way to help him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.72,0:10:04.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So time has stood still for him, and he's\Nremained the same age all these years.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.44,0:10:07.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The other two triplets\Ndidn't have any issues.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.16,0:10:09.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He alone ended up with\Na negative blessing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.68,0:10:11.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As for what that is...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.10,0:10:14.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The blessing of decay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.68,0:10:19.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An utterly horrid blessing where\Nnot only does anything he touch rot,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.10,0:10:22.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but his own body would\Nalso gradually decay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.08,0:10:28.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To make matters worse, he was born\Nwith the blessing of hyper-recovery.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.70,0:10:33.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He feels the pain of his\Nbody continuously decaying,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.52,0:10:36.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all while it regenerates\Ndue to hyper-recovery.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.84,0:10:40.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That vicious cycle will\Ncontinue until the day he dies.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.62,0:10:42.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How'd he get the negative blessing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.10,0:10:47.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once, a long time ago, we all but\Nwiped out a certain team of hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.50,0:10:48.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And to get revenge,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.64,0:10:53.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they used an ancient cursed item to saddle\Nour poor family with this wretched fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.96,0:10:54.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But unfortunately,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.87,0:10:57.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it took me longer than\NI cared to admit to even
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.52,0:11:00.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,realize he'd been given the\Nhorrible blessing of decay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.22,0:11:06.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the time I figured it out, he could\Nhardly even get around because of the pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.38,0:11:07.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great parenting, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.52,0:11:10.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After hearing all this, it's clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.88,0:11:13.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even an idiot could\Nguess what their wish is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.12,0:11:18.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In case it's not obvious, our wish is\Nto get rid of his negative blessing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.36,0:11:21.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're prepared to do\Nanything to make it happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.48,0:11:25.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This crystal coffin's likely to be\Neffective for another year to two at most.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.30,0:11:26.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe even less.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.40,0:11:29.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't have much time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.94,0:11:32.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, for what we wanted to discuss.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.40,0:11:35.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you defect with us\Nto the Netherlord's side?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:37.96,0:11:41.97,sign_1939_25_Reborn_as_a_Vend,text,0,0,0,,{\blur3\an8\fs20\pos(145,132)}Reborn as a Vending Machine,\N {\fnTimes New Roman\c&H020222&}I {\c&H161C79&}Now {\c&H1C379A&}Wander {\c&H1D6FE2&}the {\c&H2D9CED&}Dungeon
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.20,0:11:42.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Foxo!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.36,0:11:44.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you defect to the Netherlord's side?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.24,0:11:48.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Captain, how could you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.16,0:11:50.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's the one who tried to\Nkill us, or did you forget?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.30,0:11:53.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would happily sacrifice\Nevery single one of your
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.42,0:11:55.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,lives if it meant my son\Nwould no longer be in pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.06,0:11:59.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My family is the most important\Nthing in the world to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.10,0:12:03.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the sake of argument, let's just\Nsay that we did agree to defect.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.58,0:12:05.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How would we even go about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.54,0:12:09.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The commander who was on this stratum\Nseems to be willing to arrange it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.38,0:12:14.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She was already planning on contacting us,\Nactually, under the Netherlord's orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.42,0:12:15.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't say.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.18,0:12:19.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The four of us want to conquer the\Nstrata and have our wish granted.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.98,0:12:21.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Netherlord wants us to\Nget through to the final
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.04,0:12:24.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,stratum so we can take full\Ncontrol over the dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.96,0:12:26.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our interests happen to coincide.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.12,0:12:29.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really think he'll honor\Nhis side of the bargain?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.52,0:12:30.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know who he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.94,0:12:32.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I know full well who he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.88,0:12:33.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But be realistic.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.06,0:12:37.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How long would it take for us to defeat him\Nand get the dungeon back to what it was?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.02,0:12:41.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't have near enough\Ntime to do this the slow way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.10,0:12:45.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if we know we're walking into a trap,\Nit's the only hope we have to cling to!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.00,0:12:48.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I'll ask again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.64,0:12:51.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't there any of you who'd\Nbe willing to join with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.96,0:12:56.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We know the situation now, but our\Nanswer to that question is obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.38,0:12:57.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So much for negotiation.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.34,0:13:00.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that's too bad. You're Ekpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.94,0:13:01.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.40,0:13:04.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxxo, you're the one\Nwe wanted most of all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.36,0:13:07.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxxo stays with me no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.60,0:13:09.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't hand him over to anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.66,0:13:14.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Part of a clergyman's duty is to lead\Nallies from Fali back to a righteous path.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.68,0:13:18.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps a little tap from my weapons\Nwill knock you all back to your senses.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.42,0:13:19.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or kill us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.54,0:13:22.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not like we're planning\Nto go around killing anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.58,0:13:26.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All we're going to do is use the\NNetherlord so we can conquer the dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.28,0:13:28.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's likely thinking something\Nalong those same lines.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.04,0:13:31.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And he'll throw you to the\Nwolves once he's done with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.92,0:13:32.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.96,0:13:35.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lammis doesn't have full control\Nover her Blessing of Might.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.78,0:13:38.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too dangerous for her to\Nfight them under those conditions.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.86,0:13:39.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.24,0:13:47.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the save, Boxxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.90,0:13:50.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute, is this supposed to be me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.34,0:13:52.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's gotta be a better option.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.18,0:13:53.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sa-o-bi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.88,0:13:56.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll have to think of a\Nmore appropriate moniker.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.78,0:13:59.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sad to say it looks like\Nthere's no avoiding a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.06,0:14:01.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, let's do this, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.14,0:14:03.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heard loud and clear, Pops.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.76,0:14:08.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't know you excelled\Nin post-combat, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.82,0:14:10.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good enough, but barely.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.04,0:14:13.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm here too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.98,0:14:18.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's terrifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.00,0:14:20.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One hit would be lethal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.36,0:14:21.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Aka.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.36,0:14:24.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you die, I'll take care of the ladies\Nyou were planning to hook up with.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.58,0:14:27.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't want to fight,\Nbut you're forcing my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.02,0:14:31.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to jump in too, but the room's\Nso small, I'd hit my own people.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.34,0:14:34.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I'll just have to count on\NMishel and Hevee to do the heavy lifting.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.94,0:14:35.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No pun intended.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.22,0:14:40.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you're\Nslowing down already, Hevee.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.12,0:14:42.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't expect your\Nblades to be poisoned.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.78,0:14:44.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, now, the poison won't kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.94,0:14:47.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll just make you\Nhurt real bad all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.96,0:14:48.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.88,0:14:50.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why isn't it hurting you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.34,0:14:53.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, that would be\Nbecause I'm using my blessing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.36,0:14:55.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can temporarily relieve pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.48,0:14:57.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have a blessing that can relieve pain?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.70,0:14:58.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.70,0:15:01.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Neither the illusions nor\Nmind meddling are magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.42,0:15:03.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're my blessing of\Nsensory manipulation.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.64,0:15:06.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never heard of a blessing like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.88,0:15:07.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Hulemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.24,0:15:10.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Methinks you might have\Nheard of my blessing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.56,0:15:11.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.47,0:15:14.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As far as blessings go, it's\Nabout as rare as Boxo's Barrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.80,0:15:16.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you cool with me explaining it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.66,0:15:17.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.57,0:15:18.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would not object there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.60,0:15:22.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This very rare blessing allows\Nyou to control a person's senses,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.22,0:15:24.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to manipulate their sight,\Nhearing, smell, and taste,?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.96,0:15:27.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and potentially control\Nthe sensation of pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.22,0:15:29.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.13,0:15:31.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you saying it could\Nget rid of my son's pain?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.14,0:15:32.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.86,0:15:35.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I cannot use its analgesic\Neffect on other people.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.76,0:15:37.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll dagnab it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.54,0:15:39.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.88,0:15:41.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate to disappoint you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.94,0:15:45.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fighting against you is such a bummer!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.98,0:15:48.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't you, like, hold back even\Njust a little and let him get away?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.48,0:15:51.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think not. Wilmena! Aka! Shiro! Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.00,0:15:53.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here we go! What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.76,0:15:55.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are they about to try something?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.92,0:16:02.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on? He was fine\Njust a moment ago. Hevee!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.52,0:16:05.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i don't know what he did\Nto heavy But whatever they
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.98,0:16:09.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,try i'll repel it with my\Nbarrier heavy's not the
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.48,0:16:12.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,only one in this Fight who's\Nbeen hiding what he can do
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.40,0:16:16.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But i didn't turn it off
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.12,0:16:25.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the same spell filmina used in\Nthe battle against the crocodile fiends I
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.38,0:16:30.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,never thought I'd have to use the secret\Nweapon I was saving for the Nether Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.44,0:16:34.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Master Boxxo! Comrades!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.66,0:16:36.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will give chase immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.38,0:16:37.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.29,0:16:41.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't know what the captain's power\Ndoes, so going after him is too risky.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.30,0:16:43.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should see to Heavy first.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.60,0:16:45.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alas, they really fooled us, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.92,0:16:48.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose the man's not\Nour captain for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.68,0:16:50.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can you be so calm about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.70,0:16:52.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Were you putting on an\Nact to help them get away?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.66,0:16:54.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, and perish the thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.78,0:16:57.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Severe pain had me waylaid\Ntill mere moments ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.74,0:16:59.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even right now, as we speak,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.30,0:17:02.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am once again using my blessing\Nto relieve the waves of agony.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.44,0:17:06.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His blessing halted your blessing\Nand neutralized Boxo's barrier, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.50,0:17:09.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also, the captain's eyes\Nwere glowing red back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.22,0:17:10.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that was creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.48,0:17:11.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They were bright red.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.92,0:17:13.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.36,0:17:17.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From that data, my guess is that\Nit's the blessing of eye breach.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.72,0:17:21.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's practically a legend, and it\Nlets you negate other blessings.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.44,0:17:24.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The captain's blessing of eye\Nbreach means serious trouble for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.38,0:17:26.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I can't use my barrier or telekinesis,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.92,0:17:29.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm nothing but a\Nconvenient vending machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.92,0:17:30.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.06,0:17:33.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's still a useful\Nthing to be, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.10,0:17:35.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to report this to\Nthe director immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.04,0:17:38.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shall we return to the\Nvillage and seek him out?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.68,0:17:40.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we had better do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.58,0:17:44.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They just ran off and didn't think\Ntwice about leaving their son behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.36,0:17:47.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They must know we would\Nnever harm the poor child.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.36,0:17:49.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He has done nothing wrong after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.16,0:18:00.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To get right to the point, I added Kerry\NOil and the others to the wanted list.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.70,0:18:06.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To think that our comrades would betray us,\Nit would appear I have been quite naive.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.12,0:18:07.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.16,0:18:10.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish they would have\Ntold us about it from
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.10,0:18:12.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the start before making this awful choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.52,0:18:15.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Vice-Captain's temperament\Nprobably had something to do with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.72,0:18:17.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She isn't good at asking for help.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.02,0:18:20.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still wish they would\Nhave just talked to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.62,0:18:21.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.80,0:18:25.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The way they left their\Nprecious son behind,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.22,0:18:29.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that might be our fool captain's\Nway of sending a cryptic message.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.18,0:18:31.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If only they hadn't felt\Nbacked into a corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.46,0:18:35.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should probably feel angry that\Nthey've done something so treacherous,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.52,0:18:36.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.56,0:18:38.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just can't bring myself to.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.92,0:18:42.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, well, if we can\Nbelieve what Kerry Oil said,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.50,0:18:44.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they'll likely go to the final stratum and
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.60,0:18:46.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,begin their foolish attempt to conquer it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.90,0:18:47.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One question.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.88,0:18:50.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you suppose they mean\Nto travel between strata?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.62,0:18:52.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had that same thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.52,0:18:56.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Netherlord might have some magic item\Nthat allows for movement between strata.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.76,0:18:58.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or they could be planning\Nto defeat the Stratum
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.04,0:19:01.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lords and use the transfer\Ncircles from that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.50,0:19:02.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.41,0:19:04.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a Stratum Lord in\Nthe depths of each stratum.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.90,0:19:07.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A transfer circle appears\Nwhen you defeat one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.72,0:19:08.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At the same time,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.76,0:19:12.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think we really need to worry that\Nthey'll conquer the dungeon anytime soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.56,0:19:13.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.96,0:19:17.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That the four of them are not\Nnearly powerful enough on their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.16,0:19:20.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they truly mean to\Noutmaneuver the Netherlord,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.10,0:19:22.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they'll need to enlist\Nsome trustworthy comrades.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.72,0:19:27.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which means they'll likely try to win over\Nsomeone new or recruit old acquaintances.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.64,0:19:29.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, the other two menagerie folks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.26,0:19:32.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, yes, talk about a pair of oddballs.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.68,0:19:35.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If the captain can manage\Nto cajole or bribe them,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.10,0:19:37.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can very well see them\Ncoming to his family's aid.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.88,0:19:40.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, I wouldn't rule that out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.66,0:19:45.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, if Heavy's calling them oddballs,\Nthen those two have got to be super weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.34,0:19:47.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With that in mind, I think\Nwe should update our plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.80,0:19:50.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While we're attempting to restore\Nthe peace on each stratum,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.12,0:19:52.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we should also attempt\Nto make contact with the
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.28,0:19:55.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,remaining members and win\Nthem over to our side.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.18,0:19:56.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excellent, Director.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.50,0:19:59.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, while I know those two can\Nbe found somewhere in the dungeon,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.64,0:20:02.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no notion of which\Nstratum they might be on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.56,0:20:05.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was once my duty to locate\Nthem for the menagerie,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.50,0:20:08.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but that was before my\Nunfortunate imprisonment.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.28,0:20:12.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the middle of an important mission,\Nhe was detained for acts of perversion.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.46,0:20:14.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back to more pressing matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.16,0:20:17.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're in a bit of a bind now since we\Ncan't travel freely between strata.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.70,0:20:20.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I think we should return\Nto the Clearflow Lake Stratum.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.06,0:20:22.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Restoration has only just begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.92,0:20:24.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a long list of things to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.04,0:20:26.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.34,0:20:29.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to head back to Clearflow\NLake Stratum, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.86,0:20:33.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So many intense things\Nhappen on this stratum.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.38,0:20:37.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's sure been a crazy time\Nto be a vending machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.56,0:20:42.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here I am, doing something as important\Nas crushing the Netherlord's ambitions.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.98,0:20:46.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That would make sense if I were in\Nthe role of some legendary hero,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.24,0:20:48.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but, like, I'm a vending machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.78,0:20:53.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nevertheless, while my body might be\Ninorganic, my heart is still human.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.34,0:20:54.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to save everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.88,0:20:57.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A lot has happened, but let's\Nfight on together, Boxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.96,0:20:58.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.60,0:21:02.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I don't know how much I\Ncan manage as a vending machine,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.56,0:21:07.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I do know I'll devote all my electricity\Nto keeping Lamas and me together.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.94,0:21:11.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, I'm activating it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.70,0:21:14.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Has it been tampered with?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.14,0:21:14.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.05,0:21:16.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone, evacuate the transfer circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.98,0:21:19.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I would, except I can't even move.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.42,0:21:20.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxxo! Boxxo!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.96,0:21:25.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.87,0:21:26.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.72,0:21:28.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.44,0:21:32.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did I get sent to some\Nother stratum by myself?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.20,0:21:34.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Based on what Hulemy was shouting,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.16,0:21:37.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,something must have gone wrong\Nwith the transfer circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.20,0:21:40.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope everyone's okay, and\NI'm worried about llamas.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.90,0:21:45.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'd better move, or I'll be in\Nthe way if someone else transfers.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.18,0:21:51.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, so now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.90,0:21:54.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should I find a way to\Nopen the door and go out?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.60,0:21:56.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or wait here and see who comes?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.22,0:22:03.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hulemy, Director Bear, Llamas, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.74,0:22:04.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's Lammis?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.96,0:22:25.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what I'm saying to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.72,0:22:32.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I don't know what
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.40,0:22:36.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm saying to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.20,0:22:41.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to take a step and take a step.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.24,0:22:44.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to walk you through.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.38,0:22:45.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to take a step.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.62,0:22:48.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to take a step.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.04,0:22:50.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to change tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.86,0:22:56.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This melody?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.66,0:22:58.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to go over the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.26,0:23:00.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.28,0:23:02.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.14,0:23:03.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to be the only one.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.60,0:23:15.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.40,0:23:20.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,next time.
